{"id": "69972", "title": "找不着北（高干）", "author": "楚女不归", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 56, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69972.htm", "intro": "<FONT face=楷体 size=3 color=#DC143C =>新开一坑，现言高干。</FONT>\n    <CENTER><IMG src= > </CENTER>\n    <CENTER><FONT face=宋体 size=4 color=#20b2aa=>三年前，楚沁北孤身一人离开此地。</CENTER></FONT>\n    <CENTER><FONT face=宋体 size=4 color=#20b2aa=>三年后，强势回归，决心重新来过。</CENTER></FONT>\n    <FONT face=宋体 size=4 color=#20b2aa=>当出身军人世家的低调姑娘楚沁北遇见政界名流之子花心高调公子哥儿齐言东，会发生什么？</FONT>\n    <FONT face=宋体 size=4 color=#AAAAAA=>是一段转瞬即逝的露水情缘还是误会重重的虐恋深情。</FONT>\n    <FONT face=宋体 size=4 color=#20b2aa=>低调军家之女与市长之子的感情追逐就此展开。</FONT>\n    <center><b><table><tr><td title=&quot;点我收藏我吧！~&quot; style=&quot;border:3px #ffd6ff outset;&quot; bgcolor=&quot;#ffd6ff&quot; onmouseout=&quot;this.style.backgroundColor='#ffd6ff'&quot;; onmouseover=&quot;this.style.backgroundColor='#ffc1c1'&quot;;><font color=#600009><span id=&quot;favorite_1&quot; rel=&quot;1|找不着北（高干）||2012-09-08 12:45:13|楚女不归|1|2038|897657&quot; class=&quot;http://&quot;>收藏此文章</span></font></td></tr></table></b></center>", "base": "files/article/html/69/69972", "chapters": [{"title": "章节目录", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "10750666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10750667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10750668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10750669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10750670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10750671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10750672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10750673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10750674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10750675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10750676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10750677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "